WEBVTT

00:01.440 --> 00:02.840
These past few days

00:04.400 --> 00:07.067
Let her spend more time with her mother

00:09.280 --> 00:10.680
Prepare for the wedding

00:11.320 --> 00:12.720
Yes

02:06.760 --> 02:08.320
Your daughter bids farewell

02:09.320 --> 02:10.800
I hope Father

02:11.520 --> 02:13.853
Will take care of your sacred health

03:12.480 --> 03:13.880
Your Majesty

03:14.600 --> 03:16.600
This was left by Princess Xunyang

03:24.880 --> 03:26.640
This flower was raised by Yu'er

03:26.800 --> 03:29.320
She said it's the king among all fragrant flowers

03:29.400 --> 03:30.520
She wanted to wait until it bloomed

03:30.600 --> 03:32.240
Then give it to you

03:34.000 --> 04:03.000
In the sixteenth year of Longwu, Princess Deri departed Dingzhou for Yanjing. The sovereigns of Yan and Qi personally welcomed her at the city gates along ten li of red silk.

